  "solution": "Vì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> song song với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên phương trình của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có dạng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>r</mi></semantics></math> là bán kính đường tròn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Vì diện tích của hình tròn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là tâm của mặt cầu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là bán kính của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là khoảng cách từ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> đến mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Theo định lý Pytago, ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Từ đó ta được <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVậy phương trình mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
